# SQL Employee Database Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates SQL and relational database concepts using an employee database.

The project covers employee data creation, insertion, filtering, aggregation, joins, nested queries, views, triggers, and window functions.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Create and manage an employee database
- Perform SQL data retrieval
- Filter employee records
- Perform aggregate calculations
- Analyze department-level data
- Practice SQL joins
- Practice nested queries
- Create SQL views
- Create SQL triggers
- Use window functions
- Perform salary analysis

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- SQL
- Microsoft SQL Server
- MySQL concepts
- Relational Database Management Systems

